---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import NavBar from '../components/NavBar.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <NavBar />
  <article class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="mb-2 font-serif text-5xl font-bold">Now</h1>
    <p class="mb-10 text-base text-[#4a4a4a]">What&apos;s AbdulKabir up to?</p>

    <section class="space-y-3" aria-label="Current update">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Apr 29</p>
      <p class="text-[#1a1a1a]">
        I&apos;m refreshing this site, tinkering with Astro, and keeping a few
        side projects moving in small slices. I&apos;ve been reading more than
        I scroll lately, which is a welcome change. Still drinking too much
        coffee and pretending that reorganizing my desk counts as deep work.
        Curious about{' '}
        <a
          href="https://www.typescriptlang.org"
          class="text-orange-600 hover:underline"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          TypeScript
        </a>{' '}
        patterns and trying to get better at saying &quot;not now&quot; to new
        ideas.
      </p>
    </section>

    <details id="now-previous" class="mt-10">
      <summary
        class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600 transition hover:text-gray-800"
      >
        <span class="now-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Previously…
      </summary>
      <div class="relative mt-8 border-l border-gray-300 pl-6 text-gray-700">
        <span
          class="absolute left-[-5px] top-1.5 block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-gray-400"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></span>
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-gray-600">Jan 20</p>
        <p>
          I was bouncing between too many rabbit holes—sketching app ideas,
          half-finishing tutorials, and taking random photos on long walks. I
          told myself I&apos;d learn{' '}
          <a
            href="https://developer.apple.com/swift/"
            class="text-orange-600 hover:underline"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Swift
          </a>{' '}
          &quot;properly&quot; and mostly ended up refining playlists and
          bookmarking docs I&apos;d read later. A familiar kind of busy that
          wasn&apos;t quite momentum.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  #now-previous summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  #now-previous summary {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .now-chevron {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 5px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 5px solid transparent;
    border-left: 7px solid currentColor;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  #now-previous[open] .now-chevron {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
</style>
